OCGRAPH 1
DOMAIN gameplay
# THE ON-FOOT PAWN. Walking and looking are the FirstPerson template's (MoveAxis, MouseDelta, CharacterMove); there is no mesh,
# so the first-person view is the capsule's eye. While either vehicle has a driver this pawn does nothing: the vehicle system has hidden
# it, parked it in the seat and taken the camera (its camera sink points the view at the vehicle's chase rig). F (Drive.Exit) puts it
# back at the vehicle's exit point and the walking resumes the next tick, because `busy` goes false.
#
# IT TESTS "SOMEBODY IS DRIVING" WITH `driver != 0`, never with `driver == me`: an entity handle is an int that does not survive a float
# (handles start at 2^24), so two handles cannot be compared through the float pins of Equal. Only the player ever drives here.
NAME VehicleDriver
DESCRIPTION On foot: walk, look, and press E within 4 m of the sedan or the tank to get in.

CLASS AN_VehicleDriver Character view=firstperson

PARAM entity int
PARAM deltaTime float

ENTRY tick OnTick
NODE ent Param param=entity
NODE dt Param param=deltaTime
NODE sedan FindEntity name=Sedan
NODE tank FindEntity name=Tank
NODE sedanDrv AN_VehicleDriver
NODE tankDrv AN_VehicleDriver
NODE sedanDrvF IntToFloat
NODE tankDrvF IntToFloat
NODE half ConstFloat value=0.5
NODE sedanBusy Greater
NODE tankBusy Greater
NODE busy Or
NODE tick OnTick
NODE gate Branch
NODE move MoveAxis
NODE mouse MouseDelta
NODE lookScale ConstFloat value=0.15
NODE lookScalePitch ConstFloat value=-0.15
NODE yaw Multiply
NODE pitch Multiply
NODE drive CharacterMove
NODE eKey ConstInt value=4
NODE ePressed InputKeyPressed
NODE useGate Branch
NODE reach ConstFloat value=400.0
NODE sedanDist AN_GetDistance
NODE sedanNear Less
NODE sedanClose And
NODE tankDist AN_GetDistance
NODE tankNear Less
NODE tankClose And
NODE pickSedan Branch
NODE enterSedan AN_VehicleEnter
NODE pickTank Branch
NODE enterTank AN_VehicleEnter
LINK sedan.entity sedanDrv.entity
LINK tank.entity tankDrv.entity
LINK sedanDrv.driver sedanDrvF.a
LINK tankDrv.driver tankDrvF.a
LINK sedanDrvF.result sedanBusy.a
LINK half.value sedanBusy.b
LINK tankDrvF.result tankBusy.a
LINK half.value tankBusy.b
LINK sedanBusy.result busy.a
LINK tankBusy.result busy.b
LINK tick.exec gate.exec
LINK busy.result gate.cond
LINK gate.false move.exec
LINK move.then mouse.exec
LINK mouse.deltaX yaw.a
LINK lookScale.value yaw.b
LINK mouse.deltaY pitch.a
LINK lookScalePitch.value pitch.b
LINK mouse.then drive.exec
LINK ent.value drive.entity
LINK dt.value drive.dt
LINK move.forward drive.forward
LINK move.right drive.right
LINK yaw.result drive.yawDelta
LINK pitch.result drive.pitchDelta
LINK eKey.value ePressed.key
LINK drive.then useGate.exec
LINK ePressed.triggered useGate.cond
LINK ent.value sedanDist.a
LINK sedan.entity sedanDist.b
LINK sedanDist.distance sedanNear.a
LINK reach.value sedanNear.b
LINK sedanNear.result sedanClose.a
LINK sedanDist.success sedanClose.b
LINK ent.value tankDist.a
LINK tank.entity tankDist.b
LINK tankDist.distance tankNear.a
LINK reach.value tankNear.b
LINK tankNear.result tankClose.a
LINK tankDist.success tankClose.b
LINK useGate.true pickSedan.exec
LINK sedanClose.result pickSedan.cond
LINK pickSedan.true enterSedan.exec
LINK sedan.entity enterSedan.entity
LINK ent.value enterSedan.driver
LINK pickSedan.false pickTank.exec
LINK tankClose.result pickTank.cond
LINK pickTank.true enterTank.exec
LINK tank.entity enterTank.entity
LINK ent.value enterTank.driver
